# PakFactory stack (Cursor)

Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) at the repository root for full stack, domain, MCP, ADR summary, and JIRA defaults. Blog 3.0 shipped rules (PROD-1480 epic): [`docs/blog-3-jira-conventions.md`](../../docs/blog-3-jira-conventions.md).

**Non‑negotiable highlights** (detail in AGENTS — do not fork here):

- **pnpm 9.x** only; Next 16 / React 19 / Tailwind 4 / Sanity 5 / Node ≥ 20.19.
- **Not a Shopify storefront** — quote / RFQ CTAs, not carts/checkout.
- **UI:** [`DESIGN.md`](../../DESIGN.md) for look; [`ENGINEERING.md`](../../ENGINEERING.md) for RSC/scaffold; do not edit existing `packages/ui` primitives for features.
- **Packages:** [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) § Workspace packages + [ADR-019](../../docs/adr/0019-workspace-package-taxonomy.md) — platform vs feature; do not grow `@pakfactory/components`.
- **ADR-013:** props-only shared `ui/` + feature wiring in `modules/` — no cross-feature imports/forks.
- **Studio SEO:** `apps/studio/lib/seo-fields.ts` only; robots = `allowIndex` / `allowFollow` / `noImageIndex`.
- **Sanity:** schemas in git only — agents never create/patch/publish/seed documents.
- **Branches:** blog/studio/live-www → `staging`; www rebuild / this docs chore trunk → `www-new-release` (see AGENTS § JIRA).

Doc map: [`docs/ai-agent-docs.md`](../../docs/ai-agent-docs.md).
